IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `pen-entitlement`

-- Pensions Act 1956, ss 3, 11, 14 to 20 and Pensions Regulations 4, 15, 16, 18, 26 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_pen.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

